<title>UK: N.Irish police charge man with police killings.</title>
<headline>N.Irish police charge man with police killings.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Ireland police said on Wednesday that they had charged a man with killing two officers who were shot in an IRA guerrilla ambush in Lurgan last week.</p>
<p>&quot;A 29 year old has been charged with murder, two counts,&quot; a security source said. The man was due to appear later in the afternoon at Craigavon magistrates court, the source said.</p>
